p>The endothelium gets damaged.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLARpbWRl-_childItem_1","label":"ggLARpbWRl-_childItem_1","default":"<p>Nitric Oxide production drops.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLARpbWRl-_childItem_2","label":"ggLARpbWRl-_childItem_2","default":"<p>Blood vessels can't relax and open.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLARpbWRl-_childItem_3","label":"ggLARpbWRl-_childItem_3","default":"<p>Blood trickles instead of rushes.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9PUi-xaK7_text","label":"gg9PUi-xaK7_text","default":"<p><strong>An erection isn't about desire. It's about blood flow.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When you're aroused, blood rushes into your penis and gets trapped there. That's what makes it hard.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When it's working, you don't even think about it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWt134VydO_childItem_0","label":"ggWt134VydO_childItem_0","default":"<p>That's why you can only get semi-hard.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWt134VydO_childItem_1","label":"ggWt134VydO_childItem_1","default":"<p>That's why you can't stay hard long enough to penetrate.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWt134VydO_childItem_2","label":"ggWt134VydO_childItem_2","default":"<p>That's why morning wood disappeared.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWt134VydO_childItem_3","label":"ggWt134VydO_childItem_3","default":"<p>That&#039;s why you&#039;re stuck in your head during sex.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRa1ri3aga_text","label":"ggRa1ri3aga_text","default":"<p><strong>Your blood vessels can't deliver blood where it needs to go — and your erection is paying the price.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The longer you wait, the worse Endothelial Dysfunction gets.</p>"}],
